<title>SINGAPORE: Keppel Bank to launch IPO unit trust.</title>
<headline>Keppel Bank to launch IPO unit trust.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Keppel Bank said on Wednesday it will launch an initial public offering (IPO) unit trust in Singapore on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Keppel New Equities Growth Fund, a cash unit trust, will invest primarily in IPOs and newly-listed shares in the global market, with the focus on the Asia-Pacific region, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>The fund will be managed by Keppel Investment Management Ltd, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Keppel Bank.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
